      "speaker_name": "Man",
      "is_on_screen": true,
      "edit_type": "synced",
      "text": "One of the films that I was waiting to watch for the last 40 years has released, called He-Man.[cite: 4]"
    },
    {
      "start_time": "00:05.50",
      "end_time": "00:06.50",
      "start_ms": 5500,
      "end_ms": 6500,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_02",
      "speaker_name": "Woman",
      "is_on_screen": true,
      "edit_type": "synced",
      "text": "You are my He-Man.[cite: 4]"
    },
    {
      "start_time": "00:06.50",
      "end_time": "00:07.50",
      "start_ms": 6500,
      "end_ms": 7500,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
      "speaker_name": "Man",
      "is_on_screen": true,
      "edit_type": "synced",
      "text": "You're a he, you're a man.[cite: 4]"
    },
    {
      "start_time": "00:09.50",
      "end_time": "00:11.40",
      "start_ms": 9500,
      "end_ms": 11400,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
      "speaker_name": "Man",
      "is_on_screen": true,
      "edit_type": "synced",
      "text": "Skeletor laughs exactly like you.[cite: 4]"
    },
    {
      "start_time": "00:11.40",
      "end_time": "00:12.60",
      "start_ms": 11400,
      "end_ms": 12600,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_03",
      "speaker_name": "Phone Audio",
      "is_on_screen": false,
      "edit_type": "J-cut",
      "text": "(High-pitched cackling laugh)[cite: 4]"
    },
    {
      "start_time": "00:12.60",
      "end_time": "00:14.20",
      "start_ms": 12600,
      "end_ms": 14200,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_02",
      "speaker_name": "Woman",
      "is_on_screen": true,
      "edit_type": "synced",
      "text": "I don't laugh like that.[cite: 4]"
    },
    {
      "start_time": "00:14.50",
      "end_time": "00:15.60",
      "start_ms": 14500,
      "end_ms": 15600,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_02",
      "speaker_name": "Woman",
      "is_on_screen": true,
      "edit_type": "synced",
      "text": "चुप कर, चुप कर।[cite: 4]"
    },
    {
      "start_time": "00:15.60",
      "end_time": "00:16.80",
      "start_ms": 15600,
      "end_ms": 16800,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_02",
      "speaker_name": "Woman",
      "is_on_screen": false,
      "edit_type": "L-cut",
      "text": "ये नहीं कर, वो मत कर...[cite: 4]"
    },
    {
      "start_time": "00:16.80",
      "end_time": "00:19.80",
      "start_ms": 16800,
      "end_ms": 19800,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_02",
      "speaker_name": "Woman",
      "is_on_screen": true,
      "edit_type": "synced",
      "text": "Don't be lame, don't be this. Why don't you do this pod alone?[cite: 4]"
    },
    {
      "start_time": "00:20.50",
      "end_time": "00:24.40",
      "start_ms": 20500,
      "end_ms": 24400,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_02",
      "speaker_name": "Woman",
      "is_on_screen": true,
      "edit_type": "synced",
      "text": "I don't know, something is happening to me. Sometimes I feel like I'm possessed by Niki.[cite: 4]"
    },
    {
      "start_time": "00:25.50",
      "end_time": "00:27.00",
      "start_ms": 25500,
      "end_ms": 27000,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_02",
      "speaker_name": "Woman",
      "is_on_screen": true,
      "edit_type": "synced",
      "text": "Nice transition![cite: 4]"
    },
    {
      "start_time": "00:27.00",
      "end_time": "00:30.90",
      "start_ms": 27000,
      "end_ms": 30900,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
      "speaker_name": "Man",
      "is_on_screen": true,
      "edit_type": "synced",
      "text": "But, मेरे को अगर वो vines में splits मिला और उन्नीस नहीं जाए, बीस मिनट...[cite: 4]"
    },
    {
      "start_time": "00:30.90",
      "end_time": "00:31.70",
      "start_ms": 30900,
      "end_ms": 31700,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_02",
      "speaker_name": "Woman",
      "is_on_screen": true,
      "edit_type": "synced",
      "text": "नींद नहीं आती।[cite: 4]"
    },
    {
      "start_time": "00:31.70",
      "end_time": "00:33.20",
      "start_ms": 31700,
      "end_ms": 33200,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
      "speaker_name": "Man",
      "is_on_screen": false,
      "edit_type": "J-cut",
      "text": "हाँ, मतलब कचरा,[cite: 4]"
    },
    {
      "start_time": "00:33.20",
      "end_time": "00:35.00",
      "start_ms": 33200,
      "end_ms": 35000,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
      "speaker_name": "Man",
      "is_on_screen": true,
      "edit_type": "synced",
      "text": "कुछ तो कचरा चाहिए ना।[cite: 4]"
    },
    {
      "start_time": "00:35.00",
      "end_time": "00:41.00",
      "start_ms": 35000,
      "end_ms": 41000,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_02",
      "speaker_name": "Woman",
      "is_on_screen": true,
      "edit_type": "synced",
      "text": "ऐसा नहीं है मैं किसी और का हाथ पकड़ रही थी, मैं तेरा हाथ पकड़ रही थी, और इसने बोला no, no, no, don't hold my hand. ऐसे मारा मुझे।[cite: 4]"
    },
    {
      "start_time": "00:41.50",
      "end_time": "00:44.80",
      "start_ms": 41500,
      "end_ms": 44800,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_02",
      "speaker_name": "Woman",
      "is_on_screen": true,
      "edit_type": "synced",
      "text": "People who watch horror movies dealt with Covid better.[cite: 4]"
    },
    {
      "start_time": "00:45.30",
      "end_time": "00:47.00",
      "start_ms": 45300,
      "end_ms": 47000,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
      "speaker_name": "Man",
      "is_on_screen": true,
      "edit_type": "synced",
      "text": "What? What would you wish for?[cite: 4]"
    },
    {
      "start_time": "00:47.00",
      "end_time": "00:49.80",
      "start_ms": 47000,
      "end_ms": 49800,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_02",
      "speaker_name": "Woman",
      "is_on_screen": true,
      "edit_type": "synced",
      "text": "I would want the end of capitalism.[cite: 4]"
    },
    {
      "start_time": "00:51.50",
      "end_time": "00:54.00",
      "start_ms": 51500,
      "end_ms": 54000,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
      "speaker_name": "Man",
      "is_on_screen": true,
      "edit_type": "synced",
      "text": "Is there a fear you've never fully outgrown?[cite: 4]"
    },
    {
      "start_time": "00:54.00",
      "end_time": "00:55.70",
      "start_ms": 54000,
      "end_ms": 55700,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_02",
      "speaker_name": "Woman",
      "is_on_screen": true,
      "edit_type": "synced",
      "text": "Abandonment.[cite: 4]"
    },
    {
      "start_time": "00:55.70",
      "end_time": "00:58.50",
      "start_ms": 55700,
      "end_ms": 58500,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
      "speaker_name": "Man",
      "is_on_screen": true,
      "edit_type": "synced",
      "text": "Oh shit, deep मार दिया, ये तो cut समझो।[cite: 4]"
    },
    {
      "start_time": "00:58.50",
      "end_time": "01:00.50",
      "start_ms": 58500,
      "end_ms": 60500,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_02",
      "speaker_name": "Woman",
      "is_on_screen": true,
      "edit_type": "synced",
      "text": "कुछ-कुछ होता है राहुल। तुम नहीं समझोगे।[cite: 4]"
    },
    {
      "start_time": "01:02.50",
      "end_time": "01:08.50",
      "start_ms": 62500,
      "end_ms": 68500,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
      "speaker_name": "Man",
      "is_on_screen": true,
      "edit_type": "synced",
      "text": "पिक्चर ख़तम हुई, हमने देखा right. और madam is gone.[cite: 4]"
    },
    {
      "start_time": "01:08.50",
      "end_time": "01:11.80",
      "start_ms": 68500,
      "end_ms": 71800,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_02",
      "speaker_name": "Woman",
      "is_on_screen": true,
      "edit_type": "synced",
      "text": "मैं चली गयी He-Man की universe में।[cite: 4]"
    }
